SUMMARY:How to Stay Positive When Others Keep Going Negative
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nNobody can blame y
 ou for getting triggered by the horrible things that have happened and kee
 p happening\, right? But wait\, that is such a loaded statement\, let’s 
 talk about this! Join us the Sunday before Thanksgiving\, Nov 22\, 2026\, 
 for a free liberating talk on how to free yourself from the control that o
 thers still seem to have over you. Can you really stay positive when other
 s keep going so negative?\n\nIt’s an appropriate time to ask\, as famili
 es and friends gather for holiday reunion meals with varying degrees of te
 nsion in context. In the United States we just had a blue wave wash out a 
 red tide\, so emotions are high however we choose to express ourselves. I
 ’ve been myself attacked just for declaring 2027 to be the year of great
  spiritual rebirth\; I wasn’t even referring to politics and got cursed 
 for being a fool still lost in the matrix. Fortunately\, I’ve done so mu
 ch personal growth and healing that I saw clearly the energy patterns invo
 lved. So I was able to wish everyone well in their own realities.\n\nIt tu
 rns out that learning to create your own reality makes all the difference.
  And to be more accurate\, you must learn how you have always created your
  own reality. This is not something new\, but the responsibility is new. W
 e are ready for the new consciously positive understandings of all the old
  unconscious beliefs that caused negative reactions. Take the word respons
 ibility for example. In the old system\, responsibility means targeting wh
 o is to blame for a problem so they get duly punished until they fix it. T
 hat made sense when we were kids scared of harsh authority figures yelling
  “Who did this?” Well it turns out the real problem was never the mess
  that just occurred\, but rather the people who never grew up beyond dysfu
 nctional concepts of law and order\, crime and punishment\, good guys vers
 us bad guys. When everyone’s scared of getting punished for a mistake\, 
 then nobody fixes it and everyone suffers together forever. That’s been 
 society in a nutshell: a real nutcase!\n\nReal responsibility has absolute
 ly nothing to do with punishment. Threatening to hurt someone can never po
 ssibly have a good outcome\, since they will just focus on getting away fr
 om you. That’s the point of the four survival reactions of appease\, fre
 eze\, flight\, and fight\, which are great indicators of old wounds to hea
 l. In survival mode\, a person is just trying to escape pain without ever 
 healing. That’s fundamentally irresponsible\, because true responsibilit
 y changes everything for the better. You become response able\, which mean
 s that you’re able to emotionally respond in a deeply authentic way that
  sets you and others free to make your own choices.\n\nWhether people choo
 se to be positive or negative is up to them. Positive is about helping\, n
 egative is about hurting\, so the difference is ever more clear. The mirac
 le comes with discovering that when you take your own responsibility\, you
 ’re no longer affected by the people who aren’t good for you. You’re
  done with being triggered\, so now the living loving Universe is free to 
 send you the synchronistic opportunities you need to enjoy the good life y
 ou always wanted. Good people come closer\, bad people fade into the dista
 nce\, and you’re free to live happily ever after.\n\nThis is what’s fi
 nally happening at the global level in these ascension times. The cyclical
  Earth has split into two major branches: the upcycle folks who are going 
 to a fabulous new future of healing and open contact with higher beings of
  love and wisdom\, and the downcycle people who are stubbornly determined 
 to face a final apocalypse in hopes of getting rid of the bad guys forever
 . The latter group will realize too late that punishing bad guys makes the
 m the bad guys\, so they’ll get another chance in a next lower cycle. No
 w you see the stakes are as small as avoiding arguments and as big as mani
 festing heaven on Earth.\n\nFor this meetup\, be vulnerable to recall your
  highest hopes for a great future and lowest worries for how you’ll ever
  get there. I’ll explain how every consciousness exists in its own energ
 y\, so once you learn to take feedback from others for what to heal in you
 rself then you’re ready to become truly free. I’ll share techniques fo
 r diagnosing your own negativity and replacing it with your soul’s purel
 y positive identity. We’ll set healthy boundaries for constructive empat
 hy rather than remaining helplessly triggered empaths\, and conclude with 
 a guided meditation to heal the relationship between your own spirit and h
 uman sides forever.\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritual support
  group is free online every Sunday 11am-130pm EST with guided meditation a
 t the end. If you can’t stay you get the recording\; public edited video
 s go online in 2 weeks at [www.youtube.com/innerselvesmastery](http://www.
 youtube.com/innerselvesmastery) Signup here for this meeting and visit [ww
 w.signupISM.com](http://www.signupISM.com) for all events\, newsletter\, v
 ideos\, and more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Ma
 stery\nspiritual teaching and coaching\nquick-links at www.signupISM.com
