SUMMARY:Intro to Medieval Dance (FREE) at Glen Eden Pilot Park - alternati
 ng Tuesdays
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n**Oyez\, oyez\, oy
 ez!** One and All\, bring your happy feet and join us for a free introduct
 ory class in medieval dancing. No experience necessary! If you can tell le
 ft from right and count to four\, that's all you need!\nWe will meet **eve
 ry-other Tuesday** at **Glen Eden Pilot Park** at **6PM**.\n\\*\\*Registra
 tion\\*\\* is NOT required - feel free to just drop in! We have plenty of 
 space (ignore Meetup limit) and usually stay as long as dancers wish to ke
 ep dancing!\nNothing is needed to participate but we recommend comfortable
  shoes and a water bottle!\nInstructors: Larkke and Wulf
